{"hymn":"S282","parent":"E350","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Mi meta única es el mismo Dios","subtitle":"Anhelos—De Dios","syl":{"n1":"Mi","n2":["me","i"],"n3":["ta","t"],"n4":["ú","i"],"n5":["ni","m"],"n6":["ca‿es","t"],"n7":"el","n8":["mis","i"],"n9":["mo","t"],"n10":"Dios,","n11":"No","n12":"paz","n13":"o","n14":["go","i"],"n15":["zo","t"],"n16":"ni","n17":"más","n18":["ben","i"],"n19":["di","m"],"n20":["ción;","t"],"n21":"De","n22":"Él","n23":["de","i"],"n24":["pen","m"],"n25":["de","t"],"n26":"que","n27":"yo","n28":["lle","i"],"n29":["gue‿a","m"],"n30":["llí;","t"],"n31":"Por","n32":["cual","i"],"n33":["quier","t"],"n34":["sen","i"],"n35":["da,","t"],"n36":["haz","i"],"n37":["lo","t"],"n38":"mi","n39":["Se","i"],"n40":["ñor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Busca la fe su meta: el mismo Dios;","Sigue‿el amor confiando en su Señor,","Prosigue mi‿alma, apoyada‿en Él,","Hasta que cumpla Dios mi oración."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["No‿importa que el camino oscuro‿esté,","No importa qué costoso pueda ser;","Él sabe cómo‿hacerme a mí llegar","Hasta la meta con toda‿estrechez."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Sólo esto sé, no lo puedo negar;","Hago una cosa, sigo‿a mi Señor;","Mi Dios, mi gloria día‿a día es,","Y en la gloria, Él mi galardón."]}]}